---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Khao Sok Travel & Resort FAQs"
  description="Discover the beauty of Khao Sok National Park in Thailand. Our Khao Sok FAQs introduce its location, attractions, and the best time to visit."
  heroImage="/images/khao-sok-hero-cottages.jpg"
  heroTitle="Khao Sok Travel & Resort FAQs"
  heroSubtitle="The Ancient Rainforest of Southern Thailand"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Khao Sok Faqs", "href": "/khao-sok-faqs/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] font-medium uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok FAQs by Riverside Cottages</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="my-10 aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#12281b]/15 bg-black">
          <iframe
            class="w-full h-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/18hCzJ9su3s?rel=0"
            title="YouTube video player"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          We provide useful information about Riverside Cottages and the park with our Khao Sok FAQs. Find information about our resort as well as the amazing <a href="/khao-sok-national-park/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Khao Sok national park</a> right on our doorstep.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a role="menuitem" data-filter="*" href="#">All</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a role="menuitem" data-filter=".cheow-lan-lake" href="#">Cheow Lan Lake</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a role="menuitem" data-filter=".elephant-sanctuary" href="#">Elephant Sanctuary</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a role="menuitem" data-filter=".general-information" href="#">General Information</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a role="menuitem" data-filter=".khao-sok-activities" href="#">Khao Sok Activities</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a role="menuitem" data-filter=".khao-sok-national-park" href="#">Khao Sok National Park</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a role="menuitem" data-filter=".krabi-to-khao-sok" href="#">Krabi to Khao Sok</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a role="menuitem" data-filter=".raft-hike-tour" href="#">Raft Hike Tour</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a role="menuitem" data-filter=".riverside-cottages" href="#">Riverside Cottages</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a role="menuitem" data-filter=".surat-thani-khao-sok" href="#">Surat Thani to Khao Sok</a></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Why was the sanctuary opened?</span>
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Firstly, it is not a sanctuary it is a conservation / rehabilitation center.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>The aim of the center is to support <strong>rehabilitation of DOMESTIC elephants</strong> in Thailand.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>The center was opened as a means of <strong>funding their veterinary hospital</strong> and clinic needs.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>They offer f<strong>ree elephant health care</strong> and advice to <strong>any owners of domestic elephants</strong>.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Injured or sick elephants <strong>can stay at the center for an extended period,</strong> until they are returned to their owners, adopted by someone else OR surrendered to the center permanently.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>All of the funding</strong> for running the center, paying staff and running the hospital is <strong>generated through tourism</strong> tours to the conservation center.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Where is Khlong Phanom National Park?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Khlong Phanom National Park is located about <strong>30–40 minutes from Khao Sok village in Surat Thani Province, southern Thailand</strong>.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Where is Khao Sok National Park?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Khao Sok National Park is in Surat Thani in southwest Thailand. Its area is 739 km2 (285 sq mi), and it includes the 165 km2 (64 sq mi) Cheow Lan Lake
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Address: 62 Khlong Sok, Phanom District, Surat Thani 84250
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The park gates are located at Khao Sok village. <a href="/khao-sok-map-directions/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">This page will help.</a>
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>When is the best time to visit Khao Sok National Park?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          There are things to see and do in Khao Sok all year round. If you're looking for river tubing, that's best in June and September, the months with the most rainfall. The "green season" runs from May to October with alternating wet and dry weather. The weather is generally sunny and dry from November to April. <a href="/khao-sok-weather/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Find out more..</a>
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What’s the cheapest way to get from Krabi to Khao Sok?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Taking a bus is the most budget-friendly option. You also get more of a chance to mingle with the locals and see a bit more of Thailand.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What’s the best time to visit Cheow Lan Lake?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Cheow Lan Lake is open year-round. The dry season (Dec – Apr) offers clear skies; the rainy season (May – Nov) brings lush scenery and waterfalls.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What time is check in and check out?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Check in is from 2:00pm. Check out is anytime before 12:00pm. If you are arriving after 8:30pm, you must inform us ahead of time, or you cannot check in.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What should I bring when I visit Khao Sok?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Bring cool and quick-drying clothing, a bathing suit, hat, good walking shoes that you don’t mind getting wet (water shoes are never a bad idea!), a flashlight, sun protection, personal medicines, and toiletries. Shirts or pants with button pockets best for jungle hikes so you don’t lose things. Wine, beer, raincoats, mosquito repellent, and other necessities are available here.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Planning on visiting Cheow Larn Lake? Take a minute to read through our <a href="/khao-sok-lake-cheow-lan-tours/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Top Tips for your Lake trip</a>, and come prepared!
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          If you have any questions, just let us know!
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What should I bring on the tour?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          We recommend <strong>trekking shoes, insect repellent, water, swimwear and a small waterproof bag for valuables</strong>.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What is your Cancellation Policy?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The policy is very simple – <strong>we do not take any deposits</strong> and rely on the <strong>honor system</strong>. This means it is <strong>extremely important</strong> that you <strong>let us know ASAP</strong> if you need to <strong>change or cancel your reservation</strong>.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          To <strong>cancel or change a reservation</strong> please email reservations: <a href="mailto:khaosokriver@gmail.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">khaosokriver@gmail.com</a>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Or Phone: <a href="tel:+6677395159">(+66) 77 395- 159</a>
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What is the cheapest way from Surat Thani to Khao Sok?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The Phantip Travel shared van at ฿250–300 is the cheapest fare.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What is Khao Sok National Park?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Khao Sok National Park is known for being the world's oldest jungle ecosystem. This protected area of over 3,600 square kilometers is home to pristine jungle, waterfalls, swimming holes, and eye-catching limestone cliffs that rise sharply from the green canopy. <a href="/khao-sok-national-park/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Find out more ...</a>
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What if my flight is late at night?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Shared vans from Surat Thani only run during the day up to around 16:00. For late flights, book a taxi (Surat Thani to Khao Sok only) or private transfer.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What facilities do you provide at Riverside Cottages?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Laundry, international phone, and internet are available. Mobile phones may be used but signal might be weak. All houses have 24-hour electricity, but brown-out or black-outs may occur, usually lasting only a few minutes or at most a few hours.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <a href="/khao-sok-riverside-resort-facilities/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Find details of our facilities here</a>.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What do you wear to Khao Sok?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Cool, quick-drying clothing is recommended. It's also a good idea to have a bathing suit, hat, good walking shoes, sun protection, and shirts or pants with button pockets (Like <a href="https://www.urbanmonkey.com/blogs/news/different-types-of-cargo-pants-with-pictures" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Cargo Pants</a>) so you don't lose anything on jungle hikes.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What do you like most about your job?</span>
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>We must stress that these elephants are <strong>domestic and raised by humans</strong>, so they <strong>cannot take care of themselves</strong> and <strong>do not know how to live in the wild</strong>.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>This means they must <strong>rely on humans for their care</strong>, which is a <strong>huge responsibility, but highly rewarding</strong>.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What are the best things to do in Khao Sok?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          You can enjoy Khao Sok from the water with lake trips, river tubing, and canoe tours. You can also trek through the jungle, enjoy a night safari, bathe elephants, relax with a massage, and learn jungle cooking. These are some of the best things to do in Khao Sok.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What are some of the key things that you do with and for the elephants at the sanctuary?</span>
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>During the day the elephants are <strong>trained to be around people</strong> by <strong>visiting the tourists</strong>. They also get <strong>showered and bathed twice a day</strong> so that the careers can <strong>check them over for any cuts or injuries</strong>.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>At night, the <strong>elephants sleep in the forest</strong> where they can <strong>supplement their diets with jungle shrubs.</strong></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What are some of the benefits and the challenges of elephant tourism?</span>
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Benefits mean that <strong>elephants have found a new worth </strong>other than agriculture and work productivity, <strong>receiving better care than ever before</strong>.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Challenges is ignorance of tourists</strong> around <strong>how elephants need to be treated</strong>, and the <strong>high costs of caring for elephants</strong> especially in a non-working setting.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Is the Cave, Raft & Hike tour suitable for beginners?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes. The tour is <strong>moderately active</strong>, but most visitors with basic fitness can participate. The jungle hike includes uneven terrain and short climbs.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Is Tam Kaew Cave safe to visit?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes, when visited with experienced guides. <strong>Visitor numbers are limited and guides lead all cave explorations to ensure safety and protect the cave environment.</strong>
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Is Khao Sok National Park worth visiting?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes! There's always something exciting to discover in Khao Sok. Take in the views of stunning limestone cliffs, cruise around emerald Cheow Larn Lake, and spot thrilling local wildlife like monkeys, lizards, snakes, and even elephants.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <a href="/khao-sok-lake-cheow-lan-tours/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Cheow Larn Lake</a>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <a href="/khao-sok-trekking-hiking/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Trekking & Hiking</a>
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Is Khao Sok a good place for kids?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Khao Sok is a family friendly destination. Many of the river and jungle experiences are gentle and suitable for children. <a href="/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Khao Sok Riverside Cottages</a> can help you find activities that will be enjoyable for the whole family. <a href="/khao-sok-family-holiday-thailand/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Find out more ..</a>
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Is it safe to travel between Krabi and Khao Sok?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Absolutely. The routes are well-traveled and secure. If you are concerned for your safety you might prefer to take a shared minivan.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Is It Safe to Swim in Cheow Lan Lake?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes — swimming is <strong>safe in designated areas</strong>. There are no dangerous fish or animals in the lake, and the water is clean and warm. Avoid swallowing the water and always follow local safety advice.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Is Cheow Lan Lake in Khao Sok National Park?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes. The lake lies entirely within the boundaries of Khao Sok National Park, Surat Thani Province.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Is breakfast included in the room rate?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Breakfast is not included in the standard room rate, but it is included if you book one of our <a href="/khao-sok-tour-packages/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">packages</a>.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How long should you stay in Khao Sok?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          It's easy to make the most of any stay in Khao Sok, but we recommend 4 days and 3 nights for the full experience.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How long is the journey from Surat Thani to Khao Sok?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          By car or taxi ~1.5 hours. By shared van ~2.5 hours. By bus ~5 hours.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How long does the Cave, Raft & Hike tour take?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The experience typically lasts <strong>5–6 hours</strong>, including bamboo rafting, jungle hiking, cave exploration and lunch.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How long does it take to travel from Krabi to Khao Sok?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The journey takes approximately 2.5–4 hours, depending on the mode of transportation.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How do you get to Khao Sok National Park?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          To get to Khao Sok national park you can take public transportation or hire a private transfer to get to Khao Sok. Transfers can be arranged from anywhere in southern Thailand. We have a detailed price list for transfers. <a href="/khao-sok-map-directions/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Find transfers price list here</a>.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How do you explore Khao Sok?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          You can explore some of Khao Sok on your own, but the best experience is to go with a local guide. They will be able to point out wildlife and give you interesting facts about the area.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How do I return from Khao Sok to Surat Thani Airport?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Book a shared van or private transfer directly from your guesthouse, resort or hotel. Shared vans are cheapest at around ฿300. Private transfers at ฿2000 are the fastest option. You will need to book a private transfer or taxi for early or late flights. There are no GRAB or similar taxi services available in Khao Sok.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How do I get to Riverside Cottages?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Khao Sok Riverside Cottages is 2km east of Khao Sok town. A link to a map and directions can be found at the bottom of this page.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Please let us know when you plan to arrive. If you would like us to send a private car, we can pick you up anywhere in Southern Thailand – please contact us for details.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>If</strong><strong> you come via </strong><strong>public</strong><strong> </strong><strong>transport</strong>, please follow the directions below.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Get off at the Khao Sok Bus Stop (this is also where public vans stop).</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>We have a free shuttle, and our driver is often at the bus stop – he will be holding a sign that says Riverside Cottages, along with the names of our sister resorts, Coco Hostel and Riverfront Resort.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>If you do not see our driver, please call us, and we will come to pick you up. Our phone numbers are 0-77-395-159, 0-77-310-246, or 0-91-041-5061. From international phones, dial + 66 instead of 0 at the beginning. If you don’t have a phone, you can walk across the highway and ask at one the shops to call Riverside Cottages.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Detailed instructions on how to get here from Phuket, Surat Thani, Bangkok, and many other locations can be found on our <a href="/khao-sok-map-directions/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Directions</a> page. Please read this page if you need further details – it’s full of useful information and a map.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How can I book Khao Sok tours?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          For the best availability, you can book tours as part of a <a href="/khao-sok-tour-packages/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">package deal</a> when you book your accommodation. You can also talk with the front desk staff when you arrive and they can book all your tours. Khao Sok Riverside Cottages have a wealth of information including less well known, off the beaten track Khao Sok tours. <a href="/off-the-beaten-path-in-south-thailand/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Find out more ...</a>
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Do you have a restaurant?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes, we have a full service bar and restaurant that is open every day at 7:30 AM. We take the last order at 8:30 PM.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Do you accept credit cards?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Unfortunately, we are currently unable to accept credit cards at the resort. There is an ATM in the nearby town if you need to withdraw cash.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Can you tell me the story of an elephant in your care?</span>
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>One elephant came to them with a <strong>severe tetanus infection</strong> in her neck.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Tetanus is not well studied in elephants so had to <strong>apply human care</strong> strategies.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Also had to <strong>perform surgery</strong> to remove a large part of the infected area.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>The <strong>elephant is in full recovery</strong> now and showing no further signs of illness.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Can you swim in Khao Sok?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes, both Cheow Larn Lake and the local river by Khao Sok Riverside Cottages are safe and enjoyable.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Can You Hike on Your Own when you visit Cheow Lan Lake?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          No — You cannot hike on your own when you visit Cheow Lan Lake.<br /> A variety of wildlife live in the dense rainforest. It can therefore be dangerous for inexperienced visitors. You must have a local guide for all treks, ensuring both safety and ecological protection.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Can you arrange tours for us?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          You can book your activities with us once you get here, or you can book a package in advance. <a href="/khao-sok-tours/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Find details of available Khao Sok tours and activities here</a>
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Can I visit Cheow Lan lake without staying overnight?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes — day trips are available from Khao Sok Village and nearby towns.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Can I get from Khao Sok to Surat Thani ferry piers?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes. Many shared vans continue on to Donsak Pier for ferries to Koh Samui, Koh Phangan, and Koh Tao.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Are there direct buses available from Krabi to Khao Sok?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes, direct buses run from Krabi bus terminal to Khao Sok. They take around 2.5 hours and cost around 320 – 450 baht.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Are there any luxury floating bungalows on Cheow Lan lake?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes — several raft-houses now offer higher-end stays with air-conditioning, private decks, and en-suite bathrooms. However you will need to make special arrangements to book them and you will need to book well in advance. Please contact reservations for more information.
        </p>
